                "markdown": "CVE-2026-48818: Starlette: SSRF and NTLM credential theft via UNC paths in StaticFiles on Windows",
                "text": "CVE-2026-48818: Starlette: SSRF and NTLM credential theft via UNC paths in StaticFiles on Windows"
